dist/
coverage.out

# Generated by tools/genman (release workflow regenerates it).
/man/

# Everything the integration suites build: the project under test, the image
# build contexts, and an older certificates directory. All are removed on
# cleanup, so they are only ever here after a run that was killed -- which is
# exactly when they would be committed by accident.
#
# testbed/ does not strictly need this: the suite runs git init inside it, and
# a nested repository is opaque to the outer one. The siblings are plain
# directories with no such protection, and testbed-certs/ was one of them --
# which is how a private key reached this history.
#
# A prefix rather than a list, because the list was three entries added one at
# a time, each after the directory it names already existed.
/testbed*/

# Editor and sed leftovers.
*.bak
